{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10132050","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10132050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1013205001:3":{"text":"페리드, 페이 못 봤어?","source_cn":"费里德，你有见过菲吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD08493E3B5B14FC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013205002:1":{"text":"잠깐만 생각을 좀... 아, 생각났다. 페이가 그때 보석 연구 수첩을 쓰고 있었어.","source_cn":"让我回忆一下……啊，我想到了，菲那时在写着宝石研究手记。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AF8616618A0E60D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013205003:1":{"text":"그런데 갑자기 이상한 냄새가 난다고 크게 소리치더니 급히 막 뛰어나갔어. 그리고 아직 돌아오지 않았지...","source_cn":"然后突然大喊着，好奇怪的气息，就慌忙跑了出去。再也没回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F2590DABBE00214","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:梅瑞特":{"text":"메린","source":"梅瑞特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:冬青学者费里德":{"text":"상록수 학자 페리드","source":"冬青学者费里德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}